---
description: disallowed commands
alwaysApply: true
---

- Do not attempt to run development servers, production servers, or any other server processes
- Do not use `npm run dev`, `npm start`, `pnpm dev`. `pnpm run dev`, or similar commands
- Do not use `pnpm run build` or similar build commands (including `@shared/schema`; ask the user to rebuild)
- If the user asks to deploy the app, run `deploy/docker/scripts/deploy-app.sh` from the repo root (see docker-deploy.mdc). That is the only allowed production start path.
- If other server functionality is needed, ask the user to run the command themselves
- Focus on code analysis, file editing, and development tasks that don't require running servers
